{"version":1,"content":"<p>由導演馬浴柯執導兼編劇，由梁洛施、文俊輝、洪金寶領銜主演的年度犯罪動作電影《重生2》，今日正式宣佈將於11月在港上映，而每一位的角色反差極大。</p><p>好像女主角梁洛施褪去以往溫柔氣質，化身狠勁十足的復仇母親，她直言：「我的角色希拉是帶着傷口和蝕骨之</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T14:24:12.151817+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T14:01:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T14:18:09.726094+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T14:18:09.726094+00:00","content_hash":"755b8b5d219376fec777216e1ed2c80aded7cd1ad71064a497afadb20dc694ee","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}